    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1084">

                <pb facs="1571" n="1555" sameAs="frus:frus1949v06/pg1555"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">501.BB Palestine/12–1749: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the
                            Embassy in Israel
                    </hi><anchor n="1" xml:id="d1084-f1"/>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">secret</hi>
                    </seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1949-12-20T13:00:00-05:00">December 20,
                            1949—1 p. m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>768. Pls convey fol to FonOff immed. US Govt
                    has noted PriMin Ben Gurion’s statement
                    concerning Jerusalem in Knesset on Dec 13 and subsequent reports of removal of
                        PriMin’s office to Jerusalem.</p>
                <p>As a friendly govt which has followed with interest and sympathy course of
                    Israel’s development, US Govt desires to inform Israeli Govt that it considers
                    particularly unfortunate any step or course of action on part of Israel likely
                    to prejudice or complicate settlement of Jerusalem question, especially at
                    moment when problem of Jerusalem is being studied by Trusteeship Council in
                    accordance with terms of Res of UNGA of Dec 9,
                    1949.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Acheson</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d1084-f1" n="1" type="source" xml:id="d1084-f1-content">
                <p>This telegram was repeated to Jerusalem and New York.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
